      "writtenOn": "2019-08-28T18:10:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think there are two scenarios where this can happen:\n1) SMS is sent over IMS and then retried over CS without telephony\u0027s knowledge - If this is the case, then we should not support this as the ImsService API already has the ability to retry an SMS over CSFB.\n2) There was a loss in connectivity on the network temporarily and the RP-DATA was sent over IMS, but the RP-ACK was sent over CSFB. - This may be possible, but I want to make sure this is the condition you are running into before we accept this patch",
      "parentUuid": "3f60f9ea_2c5d6847",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 750,
        "startChar": 80,
        "endLine": 751,
        "endChar": 87
      },
